l the story</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"transition-content\">\n                <p>HRV is the honest number - your nervous system reporting on your cells. This is where the system beneath starts to show.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"weekly-transition-box\">\n            <div class=\"transition-icon\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Frame_2147229974_4.png\" alt=\"Month 3\">\n                <div class=\"transtion-headings\">\n                    <span class=\"transtion-title\">Month 3</span>\n                    <span class=\"transtion-subtitle\">The new baseline, measurable</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"transition-content\">\n                <p>By day 90, it's not just felt - it's on the screen. The standard you hold above starts to show in the system beneath.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
